        "code": ">>> next_token_distribution(prefix)\n\n# vocabulary: ~50,000 tokens\n# output: one probability per token\n\n{\n  'Paris':   0.4821,\n  ' Paris':  0.0930,\n  'France':  0.0117,\n  'Lyon':    0.0083,\n  ...  # every other token gets a share\n}\n# sums to 1.0  \u2014  ordering is over strings",
